<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers fully steady, fairly active.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 73.50-75.00, package 76.00. Select 70.00-73.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to Choice 2-4 1000-1250 lbs 73.00-75.00. Select 70.00-73.00.</p>
</text>
